  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainability and inclusion strategy for agricultural growth corridors in Tanzania and Mozambique - Sustain Pro. Strenghtening sustainable growth for agricultural businesses, incl ecosystem management, capacity building and upscaling of sustainable practices in agriculture.</narrative>
  </description>
